## 字符流体系

### Reader/Writer 层次
```
Reader (抽象)
├── BufferedReader       ← 高效读取（推荐）
├── InputStreamReader    ← 字节→字符桥接
└── FileReader           ← 直接读文件

Writer (抽象)
├── BufferedWriter       ← 高效写入（推荐）
├── OutputStreamWriter   ← 字符→字节桥接
├── FileWriter           ← 直接写文件
└── PrintWriter          ← 格式化输出
```

### 典型用法
```java
// 读取文件
try (BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new FileReader("in.txt"))) {
    String line;
    while ((line = br.readLine()) != null) { ... }
}

// 写入文件
try (BufferedWriter bw = new BufferedWriter(new FileWriter("out.txt"))) {
    bw.write("Hello");
}
```

> try-with-resources 自动关闭流，无需手动 close()。

